Keep user data in %LOCALAPPDATA%\Chkdraft, not beside the executable

Unless CHKD_DIR is set, Chkdraft keeps its profiles, logs, map backups and
pre-save files in a chkd folder next to Chkdraft.exe. That suits upstream's
portable download, but an installed copy writes into the package-managed
prefix (/ucrt64/bin/chkd and so on): pacman does not know those files,
removing the package leaves them behind, and the prefix need not be writable.

Use %LOCALAPPDATA%\Chkdraft instead, with the same subfolders. Local rather
than roaming AppData: a profile centres on where StarCraft is installed on
this machine, and logs and backups pile up without limit, so none of it should
follow the user to another computer. The folder comes from
SHGetKnownFolderPath rather than the LOCALAPPDATA variable, so a process
started without that variable finds it too.

CHKD_DIR still takes precedence, and is now read with _wgetenv: std::getenv
returns the value in the ANSI code page while Chkdraft treats every path as
UTF-8, so a CHKD_DIR containing a non-ASCII character was misread.

Upstream: not submitted yet; the location is a packaging choice, the CHKD_DIR decoding fix is not
Applies-to: all environments

diff --git a/src/chkdraft/mapping/chkd_profiles.cpp b/src/chkdraft/mapping/chkd_profiles.cpp
index 987ad00..41b9df4 100644
--- a/src/chkdraft/mapping/chkd_profiles.cpp
+++ b/src/chkdraft/mapping/chkd_profiles.cpp
@@ -3,19 +3,27 @@
 #include <cross_cut/simple_icu.h>
 #include <mapping_core/sc.h>
 #include <mapping_core/system_io.h>
+#include <cstdlib>
 #include <filesystem>
 #include <fstream>
+#include <shlobj.h>
 
 std::optional<std::string> GetChkdPath()
 {
-    char* cChkdDir = std::getenv("CHKD_DIR");
-    std::string chkdDir(cChkdDir != nullptr ? cChkdDir : "");
-    if ( !chkdDir.empty() )
-        return chkdDir;
-    else if ( auto moduleDirectory = getModuleDirectory() )
+    const wchar_t* chkdDir = _wgetenv(L"CHKD_DIR"); // Not std::getenv, which gives the ANSI code page rather than UTF-8
+    if ( chkdDir != nullptr && chkdDir[0] != L'\0' )
+        return icux::toUtf8(std::wstring(chkdDir));
+
+    // Keep per-user data in %LOCALAPPDATA%\Chkdraft rather than beside the executable
+    PWSTR localAppData = nullptr;
+    HRESULT result = SHGetKnownFolderPath(FOLDERID_LocalAppData, KF_FLAG_CREATE, NULL, &localAppData);
+    std::wstring localAppDataPath(SUCCEEDED(result) && localAppData != nullptr ? localAppData : L"");
+    CoTaskMemFree(localAppData);
+    if ( !localAppDataPath.empty() )
     {
-        if ( makeDirectory(*moduleDirectory + "\\chkd") )
-            return *moduleDirectory + "\\chkd";
+        std::string chkdPath = icux::toUtf8(localAppDataPath) + "\\Chkdraft";
+        if ( makeDirectory(chkdPath) )
+            return chkdPath;
     }
     return std::nullopt;
 }
